package enclavid:face-age@0.1.0;

// The world this implementation is built as, apart from `world.wit`, which a
// policy's project copies: its slot names the model it runs.

/// An estimator whose model the host runs: the model's graph and its data
/// file are layers beside the component — named for the function of its slot
/// that hands the model out — and only the face crop leaves the sandbox, to
/// that model, in a process of its own.
world with-models {
    include face-age;
    import enclavid-ext:face-age/models@0.1.0;
}
